   "docs/resource-guides/gcp/storage.md#3-declare-it-in-pskityml"
  ],
  "excerpt": "[docs/resource-guides/gcp/storage.md#3-declare-it-in-pskityml]\nWhat pskit does with it: deploys `on-invoice` with an Eventarc trigger filtered on the bucket (`google.cloud.storage.object.v1.finalized`; `deleted` events get a second Cloud Function), grants the project's Cloud Storage service agent `roles/pubsub.publisher` (required by Cloud Storage triggers), and grants pskit's invoker service account `roles/eventarc.eventReceiver`. `prefix` and `suffix` are applied by the pskit runtime, so the function is still invoked (and returns immediately) for other objects.",
  "provider": "alibaba",
  "stage": "staging",
  "mode": "ask",
  "page": "YAML",
  "multi_turn": false
 },
